data target_text_carrier_scaffold_note: String = "TargetText emit-seam carrier (Slice A1): TargetText is the typed emit-seam carrier -- a nominal newtype over emitted source text, DISTINCT from String at the model layer, so emitted content flows as TargetText and a framing String fragment is a DIFFERENT type from it. ENFORCEMENT (corrected 2026-07-15, proven by execution): the type-level compile wall does NOT fire today -- neither the v1 seed nor v2 04_infer typechecks function-application argument types (04_infer carrier-checks only Branch/Match/Loop; there is no arg-vs-param unification), so a raw String passed where TargetText is declared compiles CLEAN (verified: injected smuggle at a live serialize site, full gate compile returned 0 diagnostics). Therefore this is a DESIGN.md §5 wall-AFTER-grounding (decidable, types declared and threaded, enforcement pending), NOT a wall-by-construction. Runtime guard only: .source field-access on a String fails at eval, fail-closed at runtime. The retired no-smuggled-programs / medium_structure_containment lens (#6831) is not live enforcement. Declared FRONTIER ROW, counted and prioritizable, not a silent escape hatch: DISSOLUTION TRIGGER = application-argument typechecking in 04_infer (does not exist today; its absence means EVERY type-based construction guarantee is unenforced at the call boundary -- the real root this frontier waits on). The language is NOT carried on the carrier -- it is already determined by the target: TargetModel the serialize fold holds (operator ruling 2026-07-14: a lang tag would be a §3 nickname for the extdeps.languages module). Home is std/compilers BESIDE bound_tokens_source_text (operator ruling 2026-07-15) so that fold is carrier-NATIVE: the SINGLE String->carrier introduction is text_atom (one grammar-classified token = an atom), introduced INSIDE the token fold; the ONLY join is the grammar-owned token-sequence combinator target_text_seq (folding the grammar row's declared token order); the ONLY carrier->String exit is render_target_text (whole-value render at the artifact lift + at genuine String sinks like authority_source_text). There is deliberately NO String->TargetText lift of an already-composed unit -- that direction is the smuggle the wall closes. Scaffold (seed-layer forward subset of the v2 TargetModel grammar rows, serialize_target's inverse); dissolution trigger for the scaffold itself = the grammar-row inverse subsuming it at self-host."

